## **Summary: Interruption Handling Matrix**

| **User Action** | **Technical Reality** | **ScreenDiet Experience** |
|-----------------|----------------------|---------------------------|
| Close app early | Allowed, time saved | "Remaining: X mins" shown on return |
| Hit daily limit | Hard block via `ShieldConfiguration` | "Daily portion finished" + alternatives |
| Window ends while using | Hard cutoff via `DeviceActivitySchedule` | "Curfew in effect" + save for later |
| Request "pause" | Not possible, track as break | "Mindful pause" options |
| Request "resume" | Just reopen app | "Remaining allowance: X mins" |
| Emergency access | `ManagedSettings` temporary change | "Cheat meal" with consequences |
| Turn off entirely | Authorization revoked | "Relapse detected" + support options |
| Modify schedule | Update `DeviceActivitySchedule` | "Prescription adjusted" |

